As per the scheme, the following benefits are given to the girl child whose parents are domicile of Andaman &amp;amp; Nicobar Islands:
&lt;br&gt;

**Sl. No.****Descriptions****Amount of Assistance**1Benefits at Birth- Institution deliver₹8,000/-2Benefits at Birth- Home delivery₹5,000/-3Benefits on passing VIII Standard₹5,000/-4Benefits on passing X Standard₹10,000/-5Benefits on passing XII Standard₹10,000/-6Benefits on getting married at the age of 21 years₹5,000/-7Benefits on getting married after age of 25 years₹10,000/-&lt;br&gt;

&gt; **Note**- The incentive amount will be fixed in a bank account and must not be withdrawn before the girl attains 18 years of age, unless permitted by the A&amp;amp;N Administration.

&lt;br&gt;
